title: Refuse quoted JSON and YAML credential keys before persistence
description: Track the independent pre-existing quoted-key admission defect in GitHub issue 52. The SDK adoption PR preserves existing assignment policy and does not claim this separate parser fix. Add bounded JSON and quoted YAML key refusal controls without echoing literals; retain secret-manager and environment references. Verify remembered and exported content in genuine temporary SDK trackers.
